  "title": "Presentation Mode Gives Every Deck A PAL To Explain It",
  "summary": "Presentation Mode gives every presentation someone to give it. Hand a PAL your deck or materials and it presents them live, walking the full story from start to finish or pulling up the right slide the moment a question calls for it. The demo answers with the exact diagram, the talk your team gives over and over becomes a conversation anyone can start at any hour, and the weekly readout runs itself. The material your team already made no longer waits for a person to be free before it can be understood.",
